{
 "about": "Front ZH0: the zh-Hans glossary (plan analysis/front-plans/front-i18n-zh.md §5) that src/i18n/zh-hans/zh-hans.test.ts enforces through the SC4 lint framework (profile zh-Hans) on every Simplified Chinese string. Seeded from the French glossary's English patterns and names, re-targeted to Simplified Chinese from the English (French only as meaning context), with terms from the IAU Office of Astronomy for Education glossary and the China-VO astronomy dictionary (the national committee's 《天文学名词》, whose mainland terms win over outreach usage). A term applies when its English pattern matches the English source: the Chinese must then match the zh-Hans pattern (no word boundaries in Chinese). Names are fixed interface names (an exact name applies only to a whole string). Forbidden are the term forms this glossary rejects (您, 群集/集团 for a star cluster, 红位移, 文档 for a file, Traditional or Taiwan forms, 调查 for investigation). VIREO's own names follow the decided forms: Save 保存, Save As 另存为, Record 记录, Find 查找, Search 搜索, Show 显示, Display 显示, Slew 转动, Init/Go 初始化/开始, Scan 浏览, Clear 清除, Reset 重置, Hot List 目标列表, investigation 探究, tour 导览, lab 实验, Instructor mode 讲师模式, Demonstration Mode 演示模式, Observer's Notebook 观测者笔记本. Rows for areas still in English wait for their sub-front. Translations are web adaptations by OpenVireo, never CLEA's.",
